        <![CDATA[<p>这里收藏了许多我弹钢琴的影片，大部分是在2021 ~ 2023左右录的。<br>所有影片根据录制日期排序。<br>有一些影片由于画质受损、音质不佳没有被放进来。</p><hr><h3 id="Nocturne-Op-9-No-2"><a href="#Nocturne-Op-9-No-2" class="headerlink" title="Nocturne Op. 9, No. 2"></a>Nocturne Op. 9, No. 2</h3><p><code>Frédéric François Chopin : Nocturne Op. 9, No. 2</code><br><code>Recorded 7/10/2021</code><br><video width="100%" height="300" src="/images/piano-video-archive/chopin-nocturne-2.mp4" controls></video></p><h3 id="Reverie"><a href="#Reverie" class="headerlink" title="Rêverie"></a>Rêverie</h3><p><code>Achille Claude Debussy : Rêverie (L, 76)</code><br><code>Recorded 31/10/2021</code><br><video width="100%" height="300" src="/images/piano-video-archive/reverie.mp4" controls></video></p><h3 id="1eme-Gymnopedies"><a href="#1eme-Gymnopedies" class="headerlink" title="1ème Gymnopédies"></a>1ème Gymnopédies</h3><p><code>Erik Satie : Trois Gymnopédies - I. Lent et douloureux</code><br><code>Recorded 4/11/2021</code><br><video width="100%" height="300" src="/images/piano-video-archive/gymnopedie-1.mp4" controls></video></p><h3 id="Suite-Bergamasque-Prelude"><a href="#Suite-Bergamasque-Prelude" class="headerlink" title="Suite Bergamasque : Prélude"></a>Suite Bergamasque : Prélude</h3><p><code>Achille Claude Debussy : Suite bergamasque (L. 75) - I. Prélude</code><br><code>Recorded 5/11/2021</code><br><video width="100%" height="300" src="/images/piano-video-archive/suite-bergamasque-prelude.mp4" controls></video></p><h3 id="2eme-Gymnopedies"><a href="#2eme-Gymnopedies" class="headerlink" title="2ème Gymnopédies"></a>2ème Gymnopédies</h3><p><code>Erik Satie : Trois Gymnopédies - II. Lent et triste</code><br><code>Recorded 11/11/2021</code><br><video width="100%" height="300" src="/images/piano-video-archive/gymnopedie-2.mp4" controls></video></p><h3 id="Moonlight-Sonata-1st-movement"><a href="#Moonlight-Sonata-1st-movement" class="headerlink" title="Moonlight Sonata 1st movement"></a>Moonlight Sonata 1st movement</h3><p><code>Ludwig Van Beethoven : Piano Sonata No. 14 &quot;Quasi una fantasia&quot; - I. Adagio sostenuto</code><br><code>Recorded 20/11/2021</code><br><video width="100%" height="300" src="/images/piano-video-archive/moonlight-sonata-1.mp4" controls></video></p><h3 id="Danseuses-De-Delphes"><a href="#Danseuses-De-Delphes" class="headerlink" title="Danseuses De Delphes"></a>Danseuses De Delphes</h3><p><code>Achille Claude Debussy : Préludes, Livre 1 (L. 125) - I. Danseuses de Delphes: Lent et grave</code><br><code>Recorded 2/12/2021</code><br><video width="100%" height="300" src="/images/piano-video-archive/danseuses-de-delphes.mp4" controls></video></p><h3 id="Notturno-Op-54-No-4"><a href="#Notturno-Op-54-No-4" class="headerlink" title="Notturno Op. 54, No. 4"></a>Notturno Op. 54, No. 4</h3><p><code>Grieg, Edward : Notturno, Op. 54, No. 4</code><br><code>Recorded 13/12/2021</code><br><video width="100%" height="300" src="/images/piano-video-archive/grieg.mp4" controls></video></p><h3 id="Premiere-Arabesque"><a href="#Premiere-Arabesque" class="headerlink" title="Première Arabesque"></a>Première Arabesque</h3><p><code>Achille Claude Debussy : Deux arabesques (L. 74) - I. Andantino con moto</code><br><code>Recorded 30/12/2021</code><br><video width="100%" height="300" src="/images/piano-video-archive/arabesque-1.mp4" controls></video></p><h3 id="La-Fille-aux-cheveux-de-lin"><a href="#La-Fille-aux-cheveux-de-lin" class="headerlink" title="La Fille aux cheveux de lin"></a>La Fille aux cheveux de lin</h3><p><code>Achille Claude Debussy : Préludes, Livre 1 (L. 125) - VIII. La Fille aux cheveux de lin: Très calme et doucement expressif</code><br><code>Recorded 30/12/2021</code><br><video width="100%" height="300" src="/images/piano-video-archive/la-fille-aux-cheveux-de-lin.mp4" controls></video></p><h3 id="2eme-Gnossienne"><a href="#2eme-Gnossienne" class="headerlink" title="2ème Gnossienne"></a>2ème Gnossienne</h3><p><code>Erik Satie : Trois Gnossiennes - II. Avec étonnement</code><br><code>Recorded 22/1/2021</code><br><video width="100%" height="300" src="/images/piano-video-archive/gnossienne-2.mp4" controls></video></p><h3 id="Nocturne-Op-20-No-1"><a href="#Nocturne-Op-20-No-1" class="headerlink" title="Nocturne Op. 20, No. 1"></a>Nocturne Op. 20, No. 1</h3><p><code>Frédéric François Chopin : Nocturne Op. 20, No. 1</code><br><code>Recorded 14/2/2021</code><br><video width="100%" height="300" src="/images/piano-video-archive/chopin-nocturne-op20-no1.mp4" controls></video></p><h3 id="Wet-Hands"><a href="#Wet-Hands" class="headerlink" title="Wet Hands"></a>Wet Hands</h3><p><code>C418 : Minecraft Volume Alpha - XIII. Wet Hands</code><br><code>Recorded 20/2/2022</code><br><video width="100%" height="300" src="/images/piano-video-archive/wet-hands.mp4" controls></video></p><h3 id="Pathetique-Sonata-2nd-movement"><a href="#Pathetique-Sonata-2nd-movement" class="headerlink" title="Pathétique Sonata 2nd movement"></a>Pathétique Sonata 2nd movement</h3><p><code>Ludwig Van Beethoven : Piano Sonata No. 8 &quot;Pathétique&quot; - II. Adagio cantabile</code><br><code>Recorded 21/5/2021</code><br><video width="100%" height="300" src="/images/piano-video-archive/pathetique-mvt-2.mp4" controls></video></p><h3 id="Pavane-for-a-Dead-Princess"><a href="#Pavane-for-a-Dead-Princess" class="headerlink" title="Pavane for a Dead Princess"></a>Pavane for a Dead Princess</h3><p><code>Maurice Ravel : Pavane pour une infante défunte</code><br><code>Recorded 12/6/2022</code><br><video width="100%" height="300" src="/images/piano-video-archive/pavane-pour-une-infante-defunte.mp4" controls></video></p><h3 id="Game-of-Thrones-Theme"><a href="#Game-of-Thrones-Theme" class="headerlink" title="Game of Thrones Theme"></a>Game of Thrones Theme</h3><p><code>Ramin Djawadi : Game of Thrones Theme</code><br><code>Recorded 23/7/2022</code><br><video width="100%" height="300" src="/images/piano-video-archive/game-of-thrones.mp4" controls></video></p><h3 id="Prelude-in-C-major-from-The-Well-Tempered-Clavier-Book-1"><a href="#Prelude-in-C-major-from-The-Well-Tempered-Clavier-Book-1" class="headerlink" title="Prelude in C major, from The Well-Tempered Clavier Book 1"></a>Prelude in C major, from The Well-Tempered Clavier Book 1</h3><p><code>Johann Sebastian Bach : Das Wohltemperierte Klavier, Band I: Präludium in C-Dur, BWV846</code><br><code>Recorded 27/8/2022</code><br><video width="100%" height="300" src="/images/piano-video-archive/well-tempered-clavier-1.mp4" controls></video></p><h3 id="Canon-in-D"><a href="#Canon-in-D" class="headerlink" title="Canon in D"></a>Canon in D</h3><p><code>Johann Pachelbel : Kanon in D-Dur</code><br><code>Recorded 8/10/2022</code><br><video width="100%" height="300" src="/images/piano-video-archive/canon-in-d.mp4" controls></video></p>]]>
